2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-5354](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-5354)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nCurrently we do not run YSQL tests with TSAN enabled. This is because initial system catalog snapshot creation is disabled for TSAN. This ticket tracks enabling TSAN for all YSQL tests.\r\n\r\nMain task enabling initial system catalog snapshot creation:\r\n| Status | GHI        | Comments |\r\n| :--: | --------------- | ------------------  | \r\n|  ✅ |  #15919 | Enable initial system catalog generation for TSAN builds|\r\n| ⬜️ |  -  | Enable TSAN for YSQL tests |\r\n\r\nIssues affecting multiple YSQL tests\r\n| Status | GHI        | Comments |\r\n| :--: | --------------- | ------------------  | \r\n| ✅   |  #15938 | Multiple YSQL tests fail when TSAN enabled due to race in postgres shutdown path |\r\n|  ✅    |  #15939  | Import 'Switch flags tracking pending interrupts to sig_atomic_t' from upstream postgres to fix TSAN failures |\r\n| ✅    | #15923 | Multiple YSQL tests fail on TSAN build due to race in function pqSaveParameterStatus |\r\n| ✅    | #15962 | YSQL tests fail on Detective due to process_tree_supervisor.py failing to reclaim all processes |\r\n| ✅    | #15558 | Make IsTabletSplittingComplete wait for the tablet split manager to not be running. This issue causes many Java tests to fail at the index backfill step which disables tablet splitting and then enables it back |\r\n| ⬜️     | #16055  | lock-order-inversion observed in pgwrapper::PgSupervisor |\r\n| ⬜️    | #17295 | Multiple YSQL tests fail on enabling TSAN due to PGConn::IsBusy() |\r\n\r\nOne-off test failures\r\n| Status | GHI        | Comments |\r\n| :--: | --------------- | ------------------  | \r\n| ⬜️   | #15920  | TestAllDatatypes fails on TSAN build |\r\n| ⬜️   | #15921 | TestPgYbStat fails on TSAN build with “ERROR: ThreadSanitizer: SEGV on unknown address” |\r\n| ⬜️    | #15924 | PgRangePartitionedTableSplitTest fails when TSAN is enabled |\r\n| ✅    | #15926 | PgLibPqTest colocation tests fail when TSAN is enabled due to race in function PgLibPqTest::TestTableColocation |\r\n|  ✅     | #15928 | PgDDLConcurrencyTest_IndexCreation fails in TSAN build with race in function libpq_binddomain |\r\n| ⬜️    | #15929 | PgTableSizeTest_ColocatedTableSize fails on TSAN build |\r\n| ⬜️    | #15930 | PgTableSizeTest_PartitionedTableSize fails on TSAN build |\r\n| ⬜️    | #15931 | TestPgColumnReadEfficiency FATALs on TSAN build |\r\n| ⬜️    | #15943| TestYsqlUpgrade fails with \"Expected migration timestamp to be at most 10 mins old\" in TSAN build |\r\n| ⬜️    | #17804 | All unit tests in integration-tests_cdcsdk_ysql-test fail when enabling TSAN |\r\n| ⬜️    | #17812  | TestPgYbStat fails on TSAN |\r\n| ⬜️    | #17811  | TestYbPgStatActivity fails on TSAN |\r\n| ⬜️    | #17810 | Several PG regress tests time out on TSAN |\r\n| ⬜️    | #17809 | org.yb.loadtester.TestRF1Cluster#testDefaultTTLWithFixedRF fails only on TSAN build |\r\n| ⬜️    | #17808 | [Test] PgMiniTest_NoRestartSecondRead fails on enabling TSAN |\r\n\r\n[DB-5354]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-5354?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/15941/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/15941/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":8474090172,"node_id":"REFE_lADOBlCVUc5dX2RfzwAAAAH5GFq8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/8474090172","actor":{"login":"deeps1991","id":21131754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTMxNzU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21131754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991","html_url":"https://github.com/deeps1991","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"0e9785797df7df1c72afce21346b19719253b1cf","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/commits/0e9785797df7df1c72afce21346b19719253b1cf","created_at":"2023-02-08T23:52:04Z","